OL,3,GNEWSAKnife attacker found behind bin
OL,4,Ashed jailed 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 61-year-old man found by a police dog
OL,7,Fbehind a bin shed has been jailed for
OL,8,F10 years and four months for a knife
OL,9,Fattack.
OL,11,FBedfordshire Police had been searching
OL,12,Ffor David Butler after he attacked a
OL,13,Fman during an argument at The
OL,14,FHawthorns, Flitwick, on 17 July 2025,
OL,15,Fleaving him with life-threatening
OL,16,Finjuries.
OL,18,FButler was discovered that night with a
OL,19,Fbag containing a blood-stained towel,
OL,20,Fthree knives and his passport.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
