OL,3,GNEWSAKnife attacker found behind bin
OL,4,Ashed jailed 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn January, at Luton Crown Court,
OL,7,FButler pleaded guilty to two counts of
OL,8,Fcausing grievous bodily harm (GBH), two
OL,9,Fcounts of possession of a bladed
OL,10,Farticle and possession of a firearm
OL,11,Fwithout certificate.
